{"content_hash": "ebe5a5a2c1536644", "version_id": 674, "article_id": 68, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Halpin's two-run homer gives Guardians 3-2 win over Rays and 2-1 series lead", "title_zh": "哈尔平轰出两分全垒打，守护者3-2击败光芒，系列赛2-1领先", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/15/guardians-rays-alcs-game-3-petey-halpin-home-run", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1718653070244-e9356b63605b?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OXx8cGV0ZXklMjBoYWxwaW4lMjB0d298ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MjEwODA0Mnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Paulo Cristovam on Unsplash", "author": "Paulo Cristovam", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@paulera96?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-man-standing-next-to-another-man-holding-a-microphone-a2w2QJguYGc?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(313, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(351, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "14e97573966c"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-16", "word_count": 251, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "Petey Halpin hit a two-run homer in the fifth inning, and Gavin Williams struck out nine as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Tampa Bay Rays 3-2 on Thursday. Cleveland now leads the best-of-seven AL Championship Series 2-1.", "lead_zh": "周四，佩蒂·哈尔平在第五局轰出两分全垒打，加文·威廉姆斯投出九次三振，克利夫兰守护者队以3-2击败坦帕湾光芒队。克利夫兰目前在七场四胜的美联冠军系列赛中以2-1领先。", "preview": "Halpin's first postseason home run came on a 2-2 pitch from Griffin Jax, a 95.9 mph sinker that he drove 385 feet into the right-center-fiel", "preview_zh": "哈尔平在季后赛的第一个全垒打来自格里芬·贾克斯的一记2-2球，那是一颗95.9英里/小时的伸卡球，他将其击出385英尺，飞入右中外野看台。这使克利夫兰以3-2领先。此前，纳撒尼尔·洛在第二局以一支带打点二垒安打首开纪录，但钱德勒·辛普森在第四局以一支两分三垒安打让光芒队反超。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 662, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 93.95, "size_bytes": 564624, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 290, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 96.2, "size_bytes": 578160, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 290, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/68/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 102.55, "size_bytes": 616320, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 290, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/68/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 87.825, "size_bytes": 527904, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 290, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/68/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 96.725, "size_bytes": 581328, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 290, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/68/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@dcbf67c/content/data/versions/674.json", "paragraphs": ["Halpin's first postseason home run came on a 2-2 pitch from Griffin Jax, a 95.9 mph sinker that he drove 385 feet into the right-center-field stands. It gave Cleveland a 3-2 lead. Earlier, Nathaniel Lowe opened the scoring with an RBI double in the second, but Chandler Simpson put the Rays ahead with a two-run triple in the fourth.", "Gavin Williams allowed two runs over five innings while walking one. He struck out nine and did not allow a baserunner the first time through the order. In four postseason appearances this year, he is 2-0 with a 2.16 ERA and 33 strikeouts over 16 and two-thirds innings. Jax took the loss, allowing three runs on five hits and two walks in four-plus innings.", "Cleveland's bullpen was nearly perfect. Daniel Espino, Erik Sabrowski, Hunter Gaddis and Cade Smith combined to allow just one baserunner over the final four innings, retiring 16 of the Rays' final 17 batters. Smith struck out Yandy Díaz after a 10-pitch at-bat in the eighth to strand a runner at third, then retired the side in order in the ninth.", "Tampa Bay went down in order in seven innings, and Junior Caminero struck out four times. Rays batters struck out 13 times in Game 3, after combining for 14 in the first two games. Game 4 is scheduled for Friday, though rain is forecast. Cleveland has won five of its last six playoff games since falling behind 2-0 to the Chicago White Sox in the AL Division Series."], "paragraphs_zh": ["哈尔平在季后赛的第一个全垒打来自格里芬·贾克斯的一记2-2球，那是一颗95.9英里/小时的伸卡球，他将其击出385英尺，飞入右中外野看台。这使克利夫兰以3-2领先。此前，纳撒尼尔·洛在第二局以一支带打点二垒安打首开纪录，但钱德勒·辛普森在第四局以一支两分三垒安打让光芒队反超。", "加文·威廉姆斯主投五局，失两分，保送一次。他投出九次三振，第一轮面对打者时没有让任何人上垒。今年四次季后赛出场中，他战绩2胜0负，防御率2.16，在16又三分之二局中投出33次三振。贾克斯承担败投，主投四局多，被击出五支安打，失三分，保送两次。", "克利夫兰的牛棚几乎完美。丹尼尔·埃斯皮诺、埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基、亨特·加迪斯和凯德·史密斯在最后四局中合计只让一名跑者上垒，使光芒队最后17名打者中的16人出局。史密斯在第八局经过10球的对决后三振扬迪·迪亚兹，留下三垒残垒，然后在第九局让对手三上三下。", "坦帕湾有七局三上三下，朱尼尔·卡米内罗被三振四次。光芒队打者在第三场被三振13次，而前两场合计14次。第四场比赛定于周五举行，但预报有雨。克利夫兰在美联分区系列赛以0-2落后于芝加哥白袜队后，最近六场季后赛赢了五场。"], "body": "Halpin's first postseason home run came on a 2-2 pitch from Griffin Jax, a 95.9 mph sinker that he drove 385 feet into the right-center-field stands. It gave Cleveland a 3-2 lead. Earlier, Nathaniel Lowe opened the scoring with an RBI double in the second, but Chandler Simpson put the Rays ahead with a two-run triple in the fourth.\n\nGavin Williams allowed two runs over five innings while walking one. He struck out nine and did not allow a baserunner the first time through the order. In four postseason appearances this year, he is 2-0 with a 2.16 ERA and 33 strikeouts over 16 and two-thirds innings. Jax took the loss, allowing three runs on five hits and two walks in four-plus innings.\n\nCleveland's bullpen was nearly perfect. Daniel Espino, Erik Sabrowski, Hunter Gaddis and Cade Smith combined to allow just one baserunner over the final four innings, retiring 16 of the Rays' final 17 batters. Smith struck out Yandy Díaz after a 10-pitch at-bat in the eighth to strand a runner at third, then retired the side in order in the ninth.\n\nTampa Bay went down in order in seven innings, and Junior Caminero struck out four times. Rays batters struck out 13 times in Game 3, after combining for 14 in the first two games. Game 4 is scheduled for Friday, though rain is forecast. Cleveland has won five of its last six playoff games since falling behind 2-0 to the Chicago White Sox in the AL Division Series.", "body_zh": "哈尔平在季后赛的第一个全垒打来自格里芬·贾克斯的一记2-2球，那是一颗95.9英里/小时的伸卡球，他将其击出385英尺，飞入右中外野看台。这使克利夫兰以3-2领先。此前，纳撒尼尔·洛在第二局以一支带打点二垒安打首开纪录，但钱德勒·辛普森在第四局以一支两分三垒安打让光芒队反超。\n\n加文·威廉姆斯主投五局，失两分，保送一次。他投出九次三振，第一轮面对打者时没有让任何人上垒。今年四次季后赛出场中，他战绩2胜0负，防御率2.16，在16又三分之二局中投出33次三振。贾克斯承担败投，主投四局多，被击出五支安打，失三分，保送两次。\n\n克利夫兰的牛棚几乎完美。丹尼尔·埃斯皮诺、埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基、亨特·加迪斯和凯德·史密斯在最后四局中合计只让一名跑者上垒，使光芒队最后17名打者中的16人出局。史密斯在第八局经过10球的对决后三振扬迪·迪亚兹，留下三垒残垒，然后在第九局让对手三上三下。\n\n坦帕湾有七局三上三下，朱尼尔·卡米内罗被三振四次。光芒队打者在第三场被三振13次，而前两场合计14次。第四场比赛定于周五举行，但预报有雨。克利夫兰在美联分区系列赛以0-2落后于芝加哥白袜队后，最近六场季后赛赢了五场。", "text": "Halpin's first postseason home run came on a 2-2 pitch from Griffin Jax, a 95.9 mph sinker that he drove 385 feet into the right-center-field stands. It gave Cleveland a 3-2 lead. Earlier, Nathaniel Lowe opened the scoring with an RBI double in the second, but Chandler Simpson put the Rays ahead with a two-run triple in the fourth. Gavin Williams allowed two runs over five innings while walking one. He struck out nine and did not allow a baserunner the first time through the order. In four postseason appearances this year, he is 2-0 with a 2.16 ERA and 33 strikeouts over 16 and two-thirds innings. Jax took the loss, allowing three runs on five hits and two walks in four-plus innings. Cleveland's bullpen was nearly perfect. Daniel Espino, Erik Sabrowski, Hunter Gaddis and Cade Smith combined to allow just one baserunner over the final four innings, retiring 16 of the Rays' final 17 batters. Smith struck out Yandy Díaz after a 10-pitch at-bat in the eighth to strand a runner at third, then retired the side in order in the ninth. Tampa Bay went down in order in seven innings, and Junior Caminero struck out four times. Rays batters struck out 13 times in Game 3, after combining for 14 in the first two games. Game 4 is scheduled for Friday, though rain is forecast. Cleveland has won five of its last six playoff games since falling behind 2-0 to the Chicago White Sox in the AL Division Series.", "vocab": [{"word": "homer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "全垒打", "note": "棒球术语，home run 的简称", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "strike out", "pos": "verb", "zh": "三振出局", "note": "棒球中投手使打者出局的方式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "postseason", "pos": "noun", "zh": "季后赛", "note": "常规赛之后进行的比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "inning", "pos": "noun", "zh": "局", "note": "棒球比赛的基本单位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bullpen", "pos": "noun", "zh": "牛棚（替补投手群）", "note": "指球队的替补投手", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "baserunner", "pos": "noun", "zh": "跑垒员", "note": "成功上垒的进攻球员", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "RBI", "pos": "noun", "zh": "打点", "note": "run batted in，击球手打回的分数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ERA", "pos": "noun", "zh": "防御率", "note": "投手自责分率，衡量投手表现", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "strand", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使残垒", "note": "让跑垒员留在垒上未能得分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "retire the side", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "使对方三上三下", "note": "让三名打者连续出局", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sinker", "pos": "noun", "zh": "伸卡球", "